<view class="reminder-page"><view class="reminder-body"><view class="reminder-hero"><view><yx-icon name="bell" tone="brand" size="110"/></view><view>明天的奖励，<text>也别错过。</text></view><text>自主订阅下一次签到提醒</text></view>
 <yx-state wx:if="{{loading}}" type="loading" title="正在获取提醒服务"/>
 <view wx:else class="reminder-card ui-card"><view class="reminder-title"><yx-icon name="check" tone="brand" size="46"/><text>下一次签到提醒</text><text>{{accepted?'已登记':'未订阅'}}</text></view><text class="reminder-copy">允许后，微信可向你发送下一次签到提醒。是否送达，以微信规则为准。</text><view wx:if="{{accepted}}" class="reminder-accepted"><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="32"/><text>本次订阅已登记，实际送达以微信通知为准。</text></view></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error" bindtap="getConfig">{{error}} · 重新获取</view>
 <view class="reminder-steps"><view><text>1</text><view><text>点击下方订阅</text><text>由你主动发起订阅</text></view></view><view><text>2</text><view><text>在微信弹窗中选择允许</text><text>无需额外填写个人信息</text></view></view><view><text>3</text><view><text>按提醒回来签到</text><text>拒绝或关闭不影响正常签到</text></view></view></view><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="goSign">返回每日签到</button>
 </view><view class="reminder-footer-spacer"></view><view class="reminder-footer"><button class="ui-primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{loading || busy || !templateId}}" bindtap="subscribe">{{busy?'正在登记':(accepted?'再次订阅提醒':(!templateId?'暂未开放':'订阅下一次提醒'))}}</button></view></view>
